            "id": 126354,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dalam situasi mana kita perlu memeriksa apakah dua angka sama?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Saat memeriksa apakah jumlah nyawa pemain yang tersisa <em>tepat</em> 5</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Saat memeriksa apakah jumlah nyawa pemain yang tersisa <em>kurang dari atau sama dengan</em> 3</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Saat memeriksa apakah jumlah nyawa pemain yang tersisa <em>tepat</em> 5.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 4",
            "id": 126355,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan kode ini di konsol?</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" == \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"18\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>18</code> lalu <code>false</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>18</code> lalu <code>513</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>18</code> lalu <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 1",
            "id": 126356,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Periksa apakah nilai <code>votes</code> sama dengan <code>11</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" votes = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(votes == \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"32\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>==</code>, diikuti oleh <code>11</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 2",
            "id": 126357,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tambahkan operator perbandingan kesamaan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" == \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>==</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 3",
            "id": 126358,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tampilkan <code>false</code> di console.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" == \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"14\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>13</code>.</p></body></html>"
