            "id": 126370,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Periksa apakah <code>level</code> pengguna saat ini sama dengan <code>highestLevel</code> dengan mengetikkan <code>==</code>.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" level = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highestLevel = \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(level == highestLevel)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"50\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>==</code>.</p></body></html>"
